1. Healthy male subjects, Age: 18\~45 years old (inclusive);
2. A total body weight ≥50 kg and BMI of 19 to 26 kg/m\^2(inclusive);
3. Subjects who are willing to sign an informed consent form, able to communicate with the investigator and to complete all trial procedures as per the protocol.

Exclusion Criteria:

1. Clinically significant abnormal results for comprehensive physical examination, vital signs, routine laboratory tests \[blood routine, blood biochemistry, coagulation routine, urine routine, Fecal analysis, thyroid function and antibodies, visual acuity and ophthalmic examination (slit lamp, introcular pressure, and fundoscopy), 12-lead electrocardiogram (ECG), chest X-ray (anteriorposterior), and abdominal B-ultrasound (liver, gallbladder, pancreas, spleen, and kidney);
